  "wikitext": "Products (also called \"end products\" or \"final products\") are [[:Category:Asset|assets]] that can only be bought in the [[Market#Player_market|player market]] and cannot be bought in the [[Market#NPC_market|NPC market]]. Some of them could be a [[:Category:Technology|technology]], which may be required assets for developing from [[Blueprint]]. They can be produced normally through various [[:Category:Facility|facilities]] and can be exchanged into [[scrap|scraps]].",
