  "renderedTitle": "Product",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Products (also called \"end products\" or \"final products\") are <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Asset\" title=\"Category:Asset\">assets</a> that can only be bought in the <a href=\"/index.php/Market#Player_market\" title=\"Market\">player market</a> and cannot be bought in the <a href=\"/index.php/Market#NPC_market\" title=\"Market\">NPC market</a>. Some of them could be a <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Technology\" title=\"Category:Technology\">technology</a>, which may be required assets for developing from <a href=\"/index.php/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">Blueprint</a>. They can be produced normally through various <a href=\"/index.php/Category:Facility\" title=\"Category:Facility\">facilities</a> and can be exchanged into <a href=\"/index.php/Scrap\" title=\"Scrap\">scraps</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009085623\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:247-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009085623 and revision id 1570\n -->\n</div>",
